    EMA200:[`EMA200 看最近 200 根 ${interval} K 线（约 ${period(200)}），用于长趋势背景。数据不足时显示 -- 和中性。`,'EMA200 uses the latest 200 basis candles for long-trend context. Missing data is shown as neutral.'],
    'RSI(14)':[`衡量最近 14 根 ${interval} K 线的动量。高于 55 标记看多，低于 45 标记看空，45–55 为中性。`,'Momentum over 14 basis candles. Above 55 is bullish, below 45 bearish, and 45–55 neutral.'],
